  "core_invariants": [
    "A machine may preserve the pattern memory and work of a person; it must not inherit the person's human authority.",
    "Access is not mandate.",
    "Inheritance of credentials is not inheritance of institutional legitimacy.",
    "Digital continuity is not continuity of human authority.",
